# Design System Reference - Cyber Security Finland

> Use this reference when generating new components to match the homepage styling.

---

## 1. Color Palette

### Primary Blues
| Name | Hex | Tailwind Class | Usage |
|------|-----|----------------|-------|
| Dark Blue | `#1E2A7A` | `text-[#1E2A7A]` / `from-[#1E2A7A]` | Headings, gradients, dark button base |
| Mid Blue | `#1E40AF` | `text-[#1E40AF]` / `border-[#1E40AF]` | Borders, secondary buttons, links |
| Light Blue | `#3B82F6` | `text-[#3B82F6]` / `to-[#3B82F6]` | Gradients, hover states |
| Extra Light | `#60A5FA` | `text-[#60A5FA]` / `to-[#60A5FA]` | Text gradients, subtle accents |
| Icon BG | `#bfdbfe` (blue-100) | `bg-blue-100` | Icon background before hover |

### Neutrals
| Name | Hex | Tailwind Class | Usage |
|------|-----|----------------|-------|
| Text Dark | `#0f172a` | `text-slate-900` | Primary text |
| Text Gray | `#64748b` | `text-slate-500` | Secondary text |
| Card BG | `#f8fafc` (slate-50/50) | `bg-slate-50/50` | Card backgrounds |
| Border | `#f1f5f9` | `border-slate-100` | Card borders |
| Border Hover | `#93c5fd` | `border-blue-300` | Card border on hover |

---

## 2. Gradients

### Button Gradient (Default)
```css
bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1E2A7A] to-[#3B82F6]
Button Gradient (Hover)

css
hover:from-[#3B82F6] hover:to-[#1E2A7A]
Text Gradient

css
bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1E2A7A] to-[#60A5FA] bg-clip-text text-transparent
Icon Container Gradient (Hover)

css
group-hover:bg-gradient-to-r group-hover:from-[#1E2A7A] group-hover:to-[#3B82F6]
