        </a>
        
        <a href="/path" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-[#1E40AF] text-[#1E40AF] hover:bg-gradient-to-r hover:from-[#1E2A7A] hover:to-[#3B82F6] hover:text-white hover:border-transparent transition-all duration-300 font-medium">
          Secondary Action
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
8. Animations & Transitions

Standard Transition

css
transition-all duration-300
Hover Effects

Effect	Class
Lift up	hover:-translate-y-2
Scale	hover:scale-105
Shadow	hover:shadow-xl
Icon slide	group-hover/link:translate-x-1
Scroll Animation (Fade In)

javascript
// Add to script tag
const sections = document.querySelectorAll('section');
sections.forEach((section, index) => {
  section.style.opacity = '0';
  section.style.transform = 'translateY(20px)';
  section.style.transition = 'all 0.6s ease-out';
  
  setTimeout(() => {
    section.style.opacity = '1';
    section.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
  }, index * 100);
});
Auto-scroll Carousel

css
@keyframes scroll {
  0% { transform: translateX(0); }
  100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
}

.animate-scroll {
  animation: scroll 20s linear infinite;
  width: fit-content;
}

.animate-scroll:hover {
  animation-play-state: paused;
}
9. Responsive Breakpoints

Breakpoint	Class Prefix	Usage
Mobile (default)	none	Base styles
Small	sm:	≥640px
Medium	md:	≥768px
Large	lg:	≥1024px
Extra Large	xl:	≥1280px
2XL	2xl:	≥1536px
Common Responsive Patterns

astro
<!-- Text sizing -->
class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl"

<!-- Grid columns -->
class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8"

<!-- Padding -->
class="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"

<!-- Button sizing -->
class="px-6 py-3 sm:px-7 sm:py-3.5"
10. Layout Component Import

Always wrap pages with the Layout component:

astro
---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';

const seoConfig = {
  title: "Page Title",
  description: "Page description for SEO",
  type: "website" as const,
};
---

<Layout {...seoConfig}>
  <!-- Page content here -->
</Layout>
11. Notes for Future Component Generation

When generating new components, always use:

✅ Colors: #1E2A7A, #1E40AF, #3B82F6, #60A5FA
✅ Gradients: from-[#1E2A7A] to-[#3B82F6] / hover:from-[#3B82F6] hover:to-[#1E2A7A]
✅ Buttons: Rounded-full with gradient or outline styles
✅ Cards: bg-slate-50/50 rounded-xl with hover lift and shadow
✅ Typography: Tailwind classes matching this reference
✅ Icons: Using the Icon component with proper hover transitions
✅ Animations: transition-all duration-300 with appropriate hover effects
